OL,3,ASome say hacks, others say AI - why
OL,4,Ahave there been so many outages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe past week or so has seen a series
OL,7,Fof incidents in the tech world which
OL,8,Fhave got some people asking questions
OL,9,Fabout what's going on.
OL,11,FIn the past week, there has been a
OL,12,Fmassive Microsoft outage, an apparent
OL,13,Ftech glitch which grounded all US
OL,14,Fflights for hours, and issues for the
OL,15,FNational Security Agency (NSA). That's
OL,16,Fnot to mention outages affecting the
OL,17,Fbiggest US banks, as well as a major
OL,18,Fflaw found in a popular programming
OL,19,Flanguage.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,10602
