OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F106A1795008259
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ASome say hacks, others say AI - why
OL,4,Ahave there been so many outages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese are all separate incidents - but
OL,7,Fthe fact they have all come so close to
OL,8,Feach other has got people wondering if
OL,9,Fthey might be linked.
OL,11,FThere is no evidence to suggest this -
OL,12,Fbut they do tell us a lot about how the
OL,13,Fmodern tech world works, and where the
OL,14,Fvulnerabilities lie.
